{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/510412f13d5c3164cf5dc614973a6cc6.poster.avif?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/510412f13d5c3164cf5dc614973a6cc6.webm?t=1762087326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a group of friends insatiable for fear, you explore cursed, haunted, and terrifying places filled with dark magic. You investigate the strange events that unfold in these areas, trying to uncover their secrets and in doing so, you anger the creature that lurks there. These beings do not take kindly to curious visitors trespassing on their territory. At first, they warn you to leave... but once they realize you\u2019ve meddled too much, you become their next target. They will hunt you down, one by one. Sometimes you\u2019ll have to run, sometimes you\u2019ll have to hide and only by understanding the creature will you have a chance to hunt it down yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/ff0d15b42844077ff7ee1d845e1f2fcd.poster.avif?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/ff0d15b42844077ff7ee1d845e1f2fcd.webm?t=1762087326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring these places is far from easy. Every door you open, every cabinet you rummage through, and even your own voice can draw their attention. By piecing together clues scattered around, you\u2019ll uncover the dark stories behind each location some rooted in demonic rituals, others in human cruelty and crime. But none of this scares you, because you and your friends are <strong>Fearmates</strong> and fear is your favorite thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/35e8ba3dd0e446f08bf2f4538f53f8c4.avif?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=220 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Replayability:</strong> Every item and AI behavior is randomized each game. No matter how skilled you become, the next run will always test you in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Different Maps:</strong> Each map features its own unique story, atmosphere, and monster behavior. They won\u2019t just chase you \u00a0they\u2019ll adapt, appearing when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Increasing Difficulty:</strong> Every completed mission raises the story\u2019s difficulty, making the creatures more aggressive and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3D In-Game Voice Chat:</strong> Experience immersive proximity voice chat for realistic communication. You\u2019ll feel safer together but when separated, your only listener might be the creature itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Survival Mechanics:</strong> The events you encounter will take a toll on your sanity and health. Find and use helpful items at the right time to survive and withstand the growing terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Realistic Graphics:</strong> Powered by Unreal Engine, the lighting, atmosphere, and visuals will pull you deep into the horror.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132290?t=1762087326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/bf9075bd8e4dea6a4a460df8c833b9ad1138facc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762087326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/3e5cfbaa3fb71159387077369a488e93707e5cbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762087326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/3e5cfbaa3fb71159387077369a488e93707e5cbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762087326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/510412f13d5c3164cf5dc614973a6cc6.poster.avif?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/510412f13d5c3164cf5dc614973a6cc6.webm?t=1762087326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a group of friends insatiable for fear, you explore cursed, haunted, and terrifying places filled with dark magic. You investigate the strange events that unfold in these areas, trying to uncover their secrets and in doing so, you anger the creature that lurks there. These beings do not take kindly to curious visitors trespassing on their territory. At first, they warn you to leave... but once they realize you\u2019ve meddled too much, you become their next target. They will hunt you down, one by one. Sometimes you\u2019ll have to run, sometimes you\u2019ll have to hide and only by understanding the creature will you have a chance to hunt it down yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/ff0d15b42844077ff7ee1d845e1f2fcd.poster.avif?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/ff0d15b42844077ff7ee1d845e1f2fcd.webm?t=1762087326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring these places is far from easy. Every door you open, every cabinet you rummage through, and even your own voice can draw their attention. By piecing together clues scattered around, you\u2019ll uncover the dark stories behind each location some rooted in demonic rituals, others in human cruelty and crime. But none of this scares you, because you and your friends are <strong>Fearmates</strong> and fear is your favorite thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/35e8ba3dd0e446f08bf2f4538f53f8c4.avif?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=220 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1762087326\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Replayability:</strong> Every item and AI behavior is randomized each game. No matter how skilled you become, the next run will always test you in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Different Maps:</strong> Each map features its own unique story, atmosphere, and monster behavior. They won\u2019t just chase you \u00a0they\u2019ll adapt, appearing when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Increasing Difficulty:</strong> Every completed mission raises the story\u2019s difficulty, making the creatures more aggressive and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>3D In-Game Voice Chat:</strong> Experience immersive proximity voice chat for realistic communication. You\u2019ll feel safer together but when separated, your only listener might be the creature itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Survival Mechanics:</strong> The events you encounter will take a toll on your sanity and health. Find and use helpful items at the right time to survive and withstand the growing terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Realistic Graphics:</strong> Powered by Unreal Engine, the lighting, atmosphere, and visuals will pull you deep into the horror.</p>","developers":["EOVA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/1b776a6f5813104c789de5c5803d439edc3656fb/header.jpg?t=1762087326","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132290/1771059379/9bc46bb62d68b9705e94af5e5d4b0dbd9161b22c/1761239031/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761917093","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132290/1771059379/9bc46bb62d68b9705e94af5e5d4b0dbd9161b22c/1761239031/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761917093","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4132290/1771059379/9bc46bb62d68b9705e94af5e5d4b0dbd9161b22c/1761239031/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761917093","id":257221719,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221719/movie480.mp4?t=1761917093","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221719/movie_max.mp4?t=1761917093"},"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221719/792a4bbd23658f2b2cb66b4686cb887a7019718f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761917093","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221719/movie480.webm?t=1761917093","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221719/movie_max.webm?t=1761917093"}}],"name":"FEARMATES","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB ava